# File: makefile.wat
# Purpose: Makefile support for pmars 0.8 with Watcom compiler
# From: akemi@netcom.com (David Boeren)

# Configuration options:
#
# No.   Name            Incompatible with   Description
# (1)   /DSERVER        2                   disables cdb debugger (koth server 
#                                           version)
